    },
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/ext/ingkadam/m/4f8ff3071dc05f62/original/PH184347.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "items": [
    {
     "title": "",
     "text": "花园露台上有一个GUNNÖN 贡诺 凉棚，下面放着沙发和茶几。沙发上放着一个毛绒玩具、几个靠垫和一条休闲毯。",
     "image": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/ext/ingkadam/m/4f8ff3071dc05f62/original/PH184347.jpg",
     "href": null,
     "backgroundColor": null
    }
